---
import SiteBuilder from "./SiteBuilder";
---

<section class="builder-band">
  <div class="builder-shell">
    <div class="builder-kicker">Astro Lego Builder</div>
    <div class="builder-heading">
      <div>
        <h1>Monta la web de un cliente en minutos.</h1>
        <p>
          Sigue los pasos: negocio, páginas, estilo, paleta, tipografía, secciones y deploy.
          Al final, "Montar web" genera un proyecto Astro independiente, lo sube a GitHub y lo conecta a Dokploy.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="builder-status">
        <span>Pipeline</span>
        <strong>Builder → Proyecto → GitHub → Dokploy</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <SiteBuilder client:load />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .builder-band {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1220, #102331);
    color: #f8fafc;
    padding: 64px 20px;
  }

  .builder-shell {
    width: min(1680px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .builder-kicker {
    color: #5eead4;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .builder-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 820px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.18rem);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .builder-status {
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.24);
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .builder-status span {
    display: block;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .builder-status strong {
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .builder-heading {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
